{"5087240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MOO-A-DOODLE-DOO", "steam_appid": 5087240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5102010], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRANSFORM. MAKE NOISE. FOOL YOUR FRIENDS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOO A-DOODLE-DOO</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer hide-and-seek game where you transform into animals, objects, and ridiculous things — then use your voice to fool your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you can hide in plain sight?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/e447e1ec3a25e5adef9a06b9aa8d9f8e.poster.avif?t=1788200985\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/e447e1ec3a25e5adef9a06b9aa8d9f8e.webm?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/e447e1ec3a25e5adef9a06b9aa8d9f8e.mp4?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME ANYTHING. HIDE ANYWHERE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn yourself into a <strong>cow, chicken, zombie, car, singer, beatboxer, portable toilet</strong>, or whatever else you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever you do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't get caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/1cfa672ad47d74c620dd55124b7b920b.poster.avif?t=1788200985\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/1cfa672ad47d74c620dd55124b7b920b.webm?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/1cfa672ad47d74c620dd55124b7b920b.mp4?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOOL THEM WITH YOUR VOICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice isn't just for chatting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you transform, your voice is <strong>modulated to match your new form</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chicken should sound like a chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cow should sound like a cow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your voice to <strong>imitate what you've become</strong>, distract the Seeker, and make your friends question everything they hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the right sound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay perfectly still.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Act natural.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE ROLES. ONE CHAOTIC GAME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEEKER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/b8a7c4ed5425dd7ddc46bfd0ef1c63c5.poster.avif?t=1788200985\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/b8a7c4ed5425dd7ddc46bfd0ef1c63c5.webm?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/b8a7c4ed5425dd7ddc46bfd0ef1c63c5.mp4?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the players hiding around the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch suspicious objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And catch anyone who doesn't belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/6de45c39b266cb0ed5a17b423a91f0a5.poster.avif?t=1788200985\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/6de45c39b266cb0ed5a17b423a91f0a5.webm?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/6de45c39b266cb0ed5a17b423a91f0a5.mp4?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into something around you and disappear into the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRICKSTER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/33cadbaf909fd823f366e5d48b6b112f.poster.avif?t=1788200985\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/33cadbaf909fd823f366e5d48b6b112f.webm?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087240/extras/33cadbaf909fd823f366e5d48b6b112f.mp4?t=1788200985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the game upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause chaos, distract the Seeker, and create opportunities for the Hiders to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the best strategy isn't hiding...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's making everyone else panic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY ROUND CREATES A STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend hides as a chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walk right past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then suddenly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;MOO!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was that a cow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is that chair moving?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who just made that noise?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And why is there a suspicious toilet running away?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE FOR PLAYING WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, jump into a match, and see who can outsmart everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOO A-DOODLE-DOO is perfect for players who enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer party games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/][]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide-and-seek and prop hunting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/][]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and unpredictable gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/][]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deception and mind games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/][]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making ridiculous memories with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/][]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games where anything can happen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more friends you play with, the more chaotic it gets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and broadcasts are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please just follow these two guideline